/scratch/
/tmp/

# Source photography. Originals are 2-6MB JPEGs; only the optimised WebP in
# src/assets/images/ is committed. Regenerate with:
#   node scripts/optimise-images.mjs
/assets-src/

# Reference documents (hackathon briefs, judging criteria, MTN API PDFs).
# Kept locally, never committed: this repository is PUBLIC (ADR-0005) and these
# are not ours to redistribute. Facts we need from them go into momoAPIs.md or
# docs/, cited, in our own words.
*.pdf

# Agent worktrees (MISTAKES.md M4). A stray `git add -A` must never commit one.
.claude/worktrees/
